# NOTE: The original Figma Make export declared Git LFS rules here, but no file was
# ever actually stored via LFS (git lfs ls-files was empty; the one PNG is a normal
# git blob). This repository (the integration monorepo) does NOT use Git LFS, so the
# LFS filter rules were removed to keep a fresh clone self-contained and LFS-independent.
# See DECISIONS.md ADR-0003 and VERIFICATION.md.

# Treat binary asset types as binary (no LFS, no text/EOL munging).
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.webp   binary
*.ico    binary
*.pdf    binary
*.woff   binary
*.woff2  binary
*.ttf    binary
*.otf    binary
